		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID b419ac78-68d7-41d3-99ce-cc4523fcdfb6</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Receiving signal from RC</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">Receiving signal from RC%0D
After receiving the signal the receiver should:%0D
1. Validate the recorded signal according to the defined requirements.%0D
2. If the signal meets the requirements, send it to the Controller for interpretation.%0D
2.1 If the gate was moving at a given moment, it should stopped, remembering the direction in which it was moving.%0D
2.2 If the gate was at rest, start the movemet in the opposite direction to previous one.%0D
3. If the signal is incorrect, ignore it.</_text>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">6.2.2026::10:33:29</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">2</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID a49f94f4-98a2-4504-b993-232675443036</value>
				<value>GUID 27ead232-1655-4a4c-b180-6968ef57a2d5</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
